  "summary": "A visual effect where color fringing appears around high-contrast edges in optical systems due to lens dispersion.",
  "description": "It manifests as purple, green, or blue halos along contrasting edges, caused by different wavelengths of light focusing at slightly different points through lens elements. While historically considered an optical flaw, it has been intentionally incorporated as an aesthetic in both photography and digital imaging.",
